      "short": "No real solutions.\n\nCompleting the square gives $(x-2)^2=-17$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(x-2)^2+17&=0\\\\(x-2)^2&=-17\\end{align*}$$\nA real square cannot be negative, so there are no real solutions.",
